{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43241","headline":"燕衔泥 · 冯渚","name":"燕衔泥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双燕碌碌飞入屋，屋中老人喜燕归，裴回绕我牀头飞。\n去年爲尔逐黄雀，雨多屋漏泥土落。\n尔莫厌老翁茅屋低，梁头作窠梁下栖。\n尔不见东家黄𪅏鸣啧啧，虵盘瓦沟鼠穿壁\n豪家大屋尔莫居，骄儿少妇采尔雏。\n井旁写水泥自足，衔泥上屋随尔欲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯渚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43241.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43241","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}